SELECT 'district-growth-report', 'Case: District Growth One-Pager', 'case_study', 'Medium', 'Fintech',
       'Joins', ARRAY['group-by','report']::text[], '**Scenario.** The country manager''s one-pager: per district — users, successful transactions, and volume, in one table.

Return `district`, `users_count`, `txn_count`, and `volume`, by volume descending. Count every user in the district even if the counts come from joins.',
