SELECT 'quiet-then-gone', 'Case: Quiet Before the Churn', 'case_study', 'Hard', 'Telco',
       'Subqueries', ARRAY['anti-join','date']::text[], '**Scenario.** Churn theory: subscribers go quiet on recharges *after* the first week of June while still burning data.

Return `name` and total June-recorded data (`data_mb_total`) of subscribers with **no recharge after 5 June 2026**, heaviest user first.',
